# dependencies
node_modules

# sst
.sst
# NOTE: `sst-env.d.ts` (root + per-workspace) is intentionally NOT
# ignored. SST writes these files on `sst dev`/`sst deploy` to augment
# the `sst` module's `Resource` interface with the stack's declared
# secrets + components (e.g. `Resource.WORKOS_API_KEY`,
# `Resource.api-core`). Committing them means CI typecheck catches
# missing-Resource mistakes without having to run `sst dev` first,
# matching the funds-distribution-platform convention. Regenerate by
# running `bun sst dev` (or any deploy) and commit the diff.

# tmp files
.#*

# env
.env*.local
.env

